# kotlinx.serialization
-keepattributes *Annotation*, InnerClasses
-dontnote kotlinx.serialization.AnnotationsKt
-keepclassmembers class kotlinx.serialization.json.** { *** Companion; }
-keepclasseswithmembers class kotlinx.serialization.json.** { kotlinx.serialization.KSerializer serializer(...); }
-keep,includedescriptorclasses class com.familiasquesuman.demo.**$$serializer { *; }
-keepclassmembers class com.familiasquesuman.demo.** { *** Companion; }
-keepclasseswithmembers class com.familiasquesuman.demo.** { kotlinx.serialization.KSerializer serializer(...); }

# Retrofit (interfaces con genéricos en suspend)
-keepattributes Signature, Exceptions
-keep,allowobfuscation,allowshrinking interface retrofit2.Call
-keep,allowobfuscation,allowshrinking class retrofit2.Response
-keep,allowobfuscation,allowshrinking class kotlin.coroutines.Continuation
-if interface * { @retrofit2.http.* <methods>; }
-keep,allowobfuscation interface <1>

# OkHttp
-dontwarn okhttp3.**
-dontwarn okio.**
-dontwarn org.conscrypt.**
